          {
            "title": "Send the Course Request",
            "id": 152248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois de construirmos a URL, incluindo o parâmetro da rota, podemos usá-la para fazer a solicitação à API.</p><p>Passe a URL concluída para <code>requests.get()</code> para enviar a solicitação.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>/</code> seguido de <code>12</code> e finalmente <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois de construirmos a URL, incluindo o parâmetro da rota, podemos usá-la para fazer a solicitação à API.</p><p>Busque o curso com ID <code>12</code> usando um parâmetro de rota e passe a <code>url</code> concluída para a solicitação.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://api.example.com/courses/12&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?id=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>/</code> seguido de <code>12</code>, <code>get</code> e finalmente <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 152264,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use a variável <code>certificate_id</code> como parâmetro da rota para solicitar um certificado específico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"certificate_id = \" /><text value=\"37631\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/certificates/\" /><text value=\"{certificate_id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 37631,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;learner_id&quot;: 14689122\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;completed&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>certificate_id</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
