          {
            "title": "Find a Course Lesson",
            "id": 152252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um curso pode conter muitas lições, então um valor de rota identifica o curso, e outro identifica suas lições.</p><p>As rotas aninhadas mantêm ambos os valores próximos aos recursos que identificam.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Course ID",
            "id": 152253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada parâmetro de rota tem uma posição específica na URL, com base no recurso que ele identifica.</p><p>Adicione o ID do curso depois de <code>/courses</code> e o ID da aula depois de <code>/lessons</code> na URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>course</code> seguido de <code>lesson</code> e depois <code>course</code>, <code>lesson</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada parâmetro de rota tem uma posição específica na URL, com base no recurso que ele identifica.</p><p>Armazene <code>12</code> em <code>course</code> e <code>4</code> em <code>lesson</code>. Busque essa lição dentro desse curso.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>course</code> seguido de <code>lesson</code>, <code>course</code>, <code>lesson</code> e finalmente <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
